/A 43 0 R
/Alt (Violin plots showing the distribution of size and shape metrics for own-rooted and grafted presentations across 2021 and 2022. Plots Ai and Bi show the own-rooted metrics, while Aii and Bii display grafted metrics. Colors represent apical, middle, and basal categories. X-axis shows daylength, and y-axis indicates the value. Box plots within the violins highlight distribution patterns.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 31 0 R
/S /Figure
/T ()
>>
