17 0 obj
<<
/A 44 0 R
/Alt (Four dot plots compare plant trait metrics. Ai and Aii analyze size traits for own-rooted and grafted presentations, respectively. Bi and Bii display shape traits, also for own-rooted and grafted varieties. Each plot is divided into Apical, Middle, and Basal sections along the x-axis, showing median values ranging from negative to positive. Data points are marked by two colors representing different sample groups, numbered fourteen and thirteen.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 32 0 R
